2026-11-27  Gerd Möllmann  <gerd.moellmann@gmail.com>

	* src/nsterm.h (EmacsView): Make emacsframe a struct frame **.
	(EmacsScroller): Remove frame and window members, add
	m_lisp_window.
	(lispWindow, lispFrame): Declare new accessor methods. All users
	of window and frame in all files changed.

	* src/nsterm.m: The emacsframe member in EmacsView has been
	changed in nsterm.h from struct frame * to struct frame **. All
	uses adapted.
	(EV_TRAILER): Add a frame parameter, all call sites changed.
	(hold_event): Use igc_realloc_ambig if HAVE_MPS.
	(ns_term_init)[HAVE_MPS]: Use igc_xzalloc_ambig.
	([EmacsView dealloc]):  Free emacsframe.
	([EmacsView initFrameFromEmacs:]): Allocate emacsframe.
	([EmacsScroller lispWindow]): New method.
	([EmacsScroller lispFrame]): New method.
	([EmacsScroller initFrame:window:]): Allocate m_lisp_window.
	([EmacsScroller initFrame:window:]): Use lisp_frame
	([EmacsScroller mark]): Do nothing for igc.

	* src/nsfns.m (Fns_frame_list_z_order): emacsframe is now struct
	frame **.

	* src/nsmenu.m (ns_menu_show)[HAVE_MPS]: Don't inhibit GC.

	* src/dispextern.h (struct glyph_magtrix) [HAVE_MPS] New member
	igc_info.
	(struct face, struct face_cache, struct image)
	(struct image_cache): Use GC_HEADER.
	(FACE_CACHE_BUCKETS_SIZE): New.

	* src/dispnew.c (new_glyph_matrix) [HAVE_MPS]: Use
	igc_alloc_glyph_matrix.
	(free_glyph_matrix) [HAVE_MPS]: Use igc_xfree or xfree.
	(new_glyph_pool) [HAVE_MPS]: Use igc_alloc_glyph_pool.
	(free_glyph_pool) [HAVE_MPS]: Use igc_xfree.
	(save_current_matrix) [HAVE_MPS]: Use igc_xzalloc_ambig.
	(restore_current_matrix) [HAVE_MPS]: Use igc_xfree.
	(handle_window_change_signal_2): Renamed from
	handle_window_change_signal,
	(handle_window_change_signal): New implemenation.
	(process_pending_sigwinch) [HAVE_MPS]: New function.
	(syms_of_display) [HAVE_MPS]: Init and staticpro
	space_glyph.object.

	* src/xdisp.c (pop_it) [HAVE_MPS]: Make sure we have up-to-date
	collectable objects in bidi_it.
	(display_echo_area) [HAVE_MPS]: Don't inhibit GC.
	(unwind_format_mode_line): Unchain markers.
	(decode_mode_spec): Don't inhibit GC.
	(append_glyph, append_composite_glyph, produce_image_glyph)
	(produce_xwidget_glyph, append_stretch_glyph)
	(append_glyphless_glyph): Init glyph->frame.
	(protect_global_values) [HAVE_MPS]: New function.
	(syms_of_xdisp) [HAVE_MPS]: Additional staticpros. Let pdumper
	call protect_global_values after load.

	* etc/emacs_lldb.py (Lisp_Object): Make it work with MPS/igc.

	* etc/DEBUG (F DEBUG): Mention debugging with igc.

	* doc/lispref/internals.texi (Garbage Collection): Union
	vectorlike_header is now a struct.

	* configure.ac: Add --with-mps, enable-hecking igc_check_fwd and igc_debug.

	* build-aux/git-hooks/pre-commit (nnonmpsfiles): Add hook to keep
	commits to MPS separate.

	* autogen.sh (do_git): Changes for mps/.

	* admin/notes/git-workflow (Warning): Mention changes to MPS.

	* admin/igc.org (Introduction / Garbage collection): New file.

	* README-IGC: New file.

	* Makefile.in ($(srcdir)/configure): Depend mps/ and exec/
	configure.ac.

	* .gitignore: Add MPS telemetry output files.

	* .clang-tidy: New file.

	* mps/: New directory.

	* lwlib/lwlib.c (free_widget_value_tree): Use free_gc_handle.
	(copy_widget_value_tree): Use gc_handle_for_gc_handle as help.
	(merge_widget_value): Use gc_handle_value to compare help.
	(merge_widget_value): Use gc_handle_assign.

	* lwlib/lwlib-widget.h (widget_value): Use gc_handles for help.

	* lisp/simple.el (undo--adjust-weak-markers): New function.

	* lisp/emacs-lisp/igc.el: New file.

!!	* lisp/emacs-lisp/comp.el (batch-native-compile): Bind native comp
	speed safety and debug variables from environment variables.

	* src/Makefile.in (IGCOBJ, MPSOBJ, MPS_CFLAGS): Add.
	(EMACS_CFLAGS): Add MPS_CFLAGS.
	(base_obj): Add IGCOBJ, gc_handles.o.
	(otherobj): Add MPSOBJ.
	(dmpstruct_headers): Add more headers as dependencies for pdumper.o.
	(mps.o): New rule for building mps.o.
	(ctagsfiles1): Add MPS files for ctags files.

!!	* src/.lldbinit: should be reverted to master, I think.

	* src/.gdbinit: Pass some signals if HAVE_MPS.

!!	* src/alloc.c: Put everyting not needed for igc in #ifndef
	HAVE_MPS or similar. Call functions from igc.c to allocate objects,
	if HAVE_MPS.

	* src/bignum.c (xrealloc_for_gmp, xfree_for_gmp): Remove.
	(init_bignum): Call init_gmp_memory_functions instead of setting
	memory functions.
	(make_bignum_from_mpz) [HAVE_MPS]: New function.
	(make_bignum_bits) [HAVE_MPS]: Use make_bignum_from_mpz.
	(make_bignum_str) [HAVE_MPS]: New function.

	* src/atimer.c (start_atimer) [HAVE_MPS]: Use igc_xzalloc_ambig.

	* src/androidterm.h (GCALIGNED_STRUCT): vectorlike_header is now a struct.

	* src/androidterm.c (mark_androidterm): Don't define if HAVE_MPS.
